  "content": "<h1>DarkGlint</h1>\n<p><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong></p>\n<p>将原版附魔的光芒更改为深蓝色星云光芒&nbsp;<em><br></em></p>\n<p><em>仅客户端侧功能</em></p>\n<p>由制作<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>的同一作者团队打造（如需完整角色扮演体验，请下载<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 游戏包</a>享受任务和角色扮演玩法）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<h5>(以下特性将进一步增强您的原版游戏体验)</h5>\n<h5>本模组将您原版物品的附魔光芒与盔甲光芒更改为酷炫的深蓝色星云效果，在黑暗环境中尤为美观！可在辅助设置中将光芒强度调整为100%以获得最佳视觉效果。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/989/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/977557893110964374/1135933208790323310/javaw_Tr5W8rud3d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"801\" height=\"458\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/990/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即创建服务器并与好友畅玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>或使用横幅下方区域输入优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享25美元折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></p>",
